{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7641ba14186d11a11c782dec7060fcff2ca8ea3a23cabbc279fdd0af7bdfab35","ja":"最後の謎の解き方","zh":"最后谜题的解法","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9addab9c814bf47650cf14eace1244c9b7bb198c342f24d7d5c9ae24718e9fb7","ja":"そっか！　設計図も歯車も別の場所にあるんだ！\nじゃあ、どこかにヒントが……！？","zh":"原来是这样！图纸和齿轮都在别的地方啊！\n那么，某处会有提示……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6fb03da09c83f447cec90146184c94d5a782c233bc48ebf8095088a0ae6ade22","ja":"工房……は広いし、探索する時間が足りないよね。\nそれじゃあ、別の何かに……？","zh":"工坊……太大了，探索的时间不够用呢。\n那换成别的什么……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"69a365cb61aa21ec090cf7d16bf9ce775632c96538f04e41aa826afd5abfd155","ja":"……あっ！　解答用紙の裏の模様って、\nこの機械とそっくりだよ！　これが設計図なのかも！","zh":"……啊！答题卡背面的花纹，\n和这台机器一模一样哦！这说不定就是设计图！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6b3e23cce489e8bb09ec9440c12f136eec25688687497934f1e1a0c567222be6","ja":"ほんとだ、それっぽい！\nもしかして、解答用紙がカラフルなのも……？","zh":"真的耶，好像是这样！\n难道说，答题卡五颜六色的也是……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"20ced887cc6591d1536093242f9bf1f24e255716ebf990488aaec0c809f8ca69","ja":"……やっぱり！\n青い部分が、時計の絵みたいになってる！","zh":"……果然是！\n蓝色的部分，变得像钟表的图案一样了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"26ead03cd23898858c9c8aca650cab5ed6396ebb96e8a637f2fd2446da765f56","ja":"時計がヒントなのかな……あっ、もしかして、\n最初に渡された懐中時計！？","zh":"钟表是提示吗……啊，难道说，\n是最初递过来的那个怀表！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"40efe1f1701e84f0c06362951f306a93e827ad7e6008e694b66c916a891d01ed","ja":"見て、雪歩！　これ、裏蓋が簡単に外れるよ！\n中身は……金色の歯車だ！","zh":"你看，雪步！这个后盖很容易就能拆下来哦！\n里面是……金色的齿轮！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"aa55e184d3331c20d897548f72dc294153759b774154a2e1b19f12be191566c6","ja":"これを、解答用紙の裏の模様と照らし合わせて、\nあてはまる場所にはめ込んで……起動っ！","zh":"把这个和答题卡背面的图案对照一下，\n嵌进符合的位置……启动！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8dd0c9a90d5e9a3b65b669fbcecf7d0e99f2e72c8c06784d5347935725e13553","ja":"ウィーン……ガシャンッ！","zh":"嗡——咔嚓！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7b7d4497af21a9723fed238fe01f0f18cdc12456fbfb554a5a3ec3641e3da4ef","ja":"「接続を確認。超兵器、起動します。\n……おめでとうございます！　完全クリアです！」","zh":"“确认连接。超兵器，启动。\n……恭喜您！达成了完全通关！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"87f7f851f4f5d95a8e35e72172ad392a3db796fe9736b1c517191e20f90ba4bb","ja":"やったー！\nこれも、雪歩のひらめきのおかげだよ～！","zh":"太好啦——！\n这也多亏了雪步的点子呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c0b3f6fe68fa6e04adc55e0f09fcc379d70b3301a60a63ac55513db36e61b53c","ja":"それに、最後の歯車をハメて修理するところ、\nすごく手際がよかった！　さっすがメカニックだね♪","zh":"而且，装上最后一个齿轮修好的那一幕，\n手法真的太娴熟了！不愧是技工呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a991af6499dcc0629114a1595cf443737264a5cd9c541002d43139af5a6a4668","ja":"そんな。最後の修理が間に合ったのは、\n恵美ちゃんがいろいろ気づいてくれたおかげだよ！","zh":"没那回事。最后的修理能赶上，\n多亏了惠美注意到了很多细节呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1647.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"de1bf5bf7603da160af74549e2dd95a3058203c9ca0a03008eccf694387f51ae","ja":"そうなの？　なら、ふたり一緒だと最強\nってことだね！　にゃははっ♪","zh":"是这样吗？那只要我们两个人在一起，\n就是最强了对吧！喵哈哈♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
